<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ENGLAND V ITALY KEY MATCH STATISTICS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND V ITALY KEY MATCH STATISTICS.</headline>
<dateline>NANTES, France 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>England had two shots on</p>
<p>target and scored from both of them in their 2-0 win over Italy</p>
<p>in the Tournoi de France on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Official statistics supplied by Tournoi organisers:</p>
<p>		    England		  Italy</p>
<p> Goals		 2			  0</p>
<p> Goal attempts     2			  3</p>
<p> Shots wide	  4			  5</p>
<p> Corners	     9			  4</p>
<p> Free kicks	 20			 17</p>
<p> Offsides	    4			  0</p>
</text>
